COP 4: Position one?
COP 2: Negative.

984
01:36:51.827 --> 01:36:54.038
COP 4: Position two?
COP 3: Negative.

985
01:37:00.378 --> 01:37:01.713
(SPEAKING FRENCH)

986
01:37:09.012 --> 01:37:11.598
COP 1: Position three, motorcycle.

987
01:37:12.641 --> 01:37:13.976
COP 3: Negative.

988
01:37:14.143 --> 01:37:15.186
COP 5: Negative.

989
01:37:32.663 --> 01:37:34.415
